Containment Strategies
Short-term:
- Isolate affected systems
- Block malicious IPs
- Disable compromised accounts
- Preserve evidence

Long-term:
- System patches
- Access reviews
- Architecture changes
- Process improvements

Eradication Steps
Actions:
- Remove malware
- Close vulnerabilities
- Clean systems
- Verify integrity

[Note: Update eradication checklist - PENDING]

Recovery Process
Activities:
- Restore from backups
- Validate functionality
- Monitor for recurrence
- Document lessons learned

Post-Incident Activities
Tasks:
- Root cause analysis
- Report generation
- Process improvement
- Training updates

